   "shape_m": "ul",
   "html_text": "Axioms guaranteeing the existence of mereological sums are replaced by non-singular or plural reference. (See also Nicolas 2009 on mereological constancy and Nicolas 2021 on mixtures and mass terms.) Combined with a generalized notion of covering, this allows a treatment of identity statements different from that offered by the mixed set-theoretic and mereological approach (where what remains identical over time is a certain mereological sum).",
